         "id": "a",
         "prompt": "Find \\( f'(x) \\). Find all values of \\( x \\) in the open interval \\( 0 < x < 2\\pi \\) at which \\( f \\) has a critical point.",
         "setup_required": false,
         "answer_latex": "x = \\frac{\\pi}{3}, \\ x = \\pi, \\ x = \\frac{5\\pi}{3}",
         "worked_solution": [
            {
               "text": "Chain rule on sin^2 x.",
               "latex": "f'(x) = 2\\sin x\\cos x - \\sin x = \\sin x\\,(2\\cos x - 1)"
            },
            {
               "text": "Set the derivative equal to zero.",
               "latex": "\\sin x\\,(2\\cos x - 1) = 0"
            },
            {
               "text": "sin x = 0 gives x = pi, and cos x = 1/2 gives x = pi/3 and 5pi/3.",
               "latex": "x = \\frac{\\pi}{3}, \\ x = \\pi, \\ x = \\frac{5\\pi}{3}"
            }
         ],
         "points": [
            {
